d the real  story here though  is not the journalist it's not us it's  the people of ukraine it's the civilians  who are picking up arms to defend their  country tonight it is the women and  children who are currently sleeping in  the subway system of this capital city  because they are worried about air  campaigns and it's the soldiers on the  front lines who are currently risking  their lives for the sovereignty of  ukraine well you are bringing us their  stories so well trey yanks thank you no  doubt we'll see you a little bit later  tonight hey sean hannity here hey click  here to subscribe to fox news youtube  page and catch our hottest interviews  and most compelling analysis you will  not get it anywhere else
 

